        <mxCell id="X61RnXW4YofN9kBGOQYU-67" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="Adaptor - collect data from the peripherals&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;and inserting into the cache.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;They are inside corehost, SNMPadaptor, turbineadaptor,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;partcontrolleradaptor - checks if the configuration is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;proper, and checks if PPC is online.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;then we can see the online data in the windsurfer from PPC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;RTA is configured using the MDB files or in tables.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Modbus protocol, OPC DA (unsecure), OPC UA (secure)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
